      "source": "<a href=\"CassandraMappingEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping.event\"><code>Mapping event</code></a> triggered before inserting or updating a row in the database. Before save\nis invoked after <a href=\"BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping.event\"><code>converting the entity</code></a> into a <code>Statement</code>. This is useful to let\nthe mapping layer derive values into the statement while the save callback can either update the domain object\nwithout reflecting the changes in the statement. Another use is to inspect the <code>Statement</code>.",
      "translation": "在将实体转换为<a href=\"BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping.event\"><code>Statement</code></a>之前，会触发<a href=\"CassandraMappingEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping.event\"><code>Mapping event</code></a>，该事件在数据库插入或更新行之前发生。在调用<code>save</code>之前，此机制允许映射层将值推入语句中，而保存回调则可以在不反映这些变化到语句的情况下更新域对象。另一种用途是检查<code>Statement</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
